			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":1562430,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234237425","appid":1562430,"accountid":78219265,"playtime_at_review":1440,"review_text":"TLDR: A fun and seemingly-cozy fishing game with a dark underside. GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW: Dredge opens with the player arriving at the island town of Greater Marrow, learning they are replacing the previous fisherman. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198038484993\/recommended\/1562430\/","votes_up":8}]},{"appid":2141730,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234261060","appid":2141730,"accountid":1445475224,"playtime_at_review":610,"review_text":"Very good game with nice graphics. It wasn\u00b4t too scary, but it was fun to play with friends. Therefore I don\u00b4t think it would be the same playing alone. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199405740952\/recommended\/2141730\/","votes_up":4}]},{"appid":2531310,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234288667","appid":2531310,"accountid":251348881,"playtime_at_review":1188,"review_text":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=hwFEe5xFD2E Ellie and Abby\u2019s journey hits you with an incredible amount of emotional weight and tension, telling a really gripping story about revenge and grief. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198211614609\/recommended\/2531310\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":2075800,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234295133","appid":2075800,"accountid":11459074,"playtime_at_review":1461,"review_text":"The story benefits from avoiding the usual Star Wars formula. Instead of constantly putting Luke , Vader or other famous characters at the centre, STAR WARS Zero Company creates its own group of soldiers, mercenaries, Jedi ,...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197971724802\/recommended\/2075800\/","votes_up":9}]},{"appid":2492670,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234264882","appid":2492670,"accountid":85782993,"playtime_at_review":4611,"review_text":"Excellent port. After 8 playthroughs can confirm the game runs Solid. For controller players you can also aim with the mouse during rail sections or while moving on the controller to aim the rail gun faster for act 3 bike...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198046048721\/recommended\/2492670\/","votes_up":10}]},{"appid":3929470,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234262749","appid":3929470,"accountid":1864023864,"playtime_at_review":110,"review_text":"The technical state is probably the biggest problem. For a 1.0 release, crashes shouldn't be happening. Simple as that. But after the initial frustration, I found myself enjoying the actual game. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199824289592\/recommended\/3929470\/","votes_up":14}]},{"appid":244210,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234284319","appid":244210,"accountid":75040558,"playtime_at_review":4124,"review_text":"Assetto Corsa is basically the Garry\u2019s Mod of sim racing. You can create a clean GT7-style UI, have working multimedia systems in cars with music or even YouTube, customize almost everything you want, and get pretty much any...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198035306286\/recommended\/244210\/","votes_up":4}]},{"appid":2713000,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234238371","appid":2713000,"accountid":294757574,"playtime_at_review":439,"review_text":"Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy \u2014 a brilliant return for the series! Well, the new A Plague Tale is finally here, and what can I say? Unlike Innocence and Requiem, where the main focus was on stealth, survival, and Amicia\u2019s...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198255023302\/recommended\/2713000\/","votes_up":12},{"recommendationid":"234255205","appid":2713000,"accountid":1266271618,"playtime_at_review":794,"review_text":"As someone who really loved both previous A Plague Tale Series, I went into Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy with a lot of expectations. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199226537346\/recommended\/2713000\/","votes_up":8},{"recommendationid":"234278658","appid":2713000,"accountid":198977792,"playtime_at_review":776,"review_text":"Resonance is a beautiful game that, for me as a huge fan of the series since its very first game, is certainly a must-play title while waiting for (hopefully!) the next chapter of Amicia\u2019s story. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198159243520\/recommended\/2713000\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":3614130,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234272353","appid":3614130,"accountid":241347643,"playtime_at_review":1724,"review_text":"Shelves and Sorcery: Tidy Up the Enchanted Shop 10-30+ hours to complete, Shelves and Sorcery is new to the new Tidy Up genre that\u2019s recently gotten wildly popular thanks to Librarian: Tidy Up the Arcane Library, and if...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198201613371\/recommended\/3614130\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":3905450,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234250466","appid":3905450,"accountid":72351586,"playtime_at_review":139,"review_text":"So far really fun co-op game! Reminds me a little bit of game called It Takes Two, but with cars, easier puzzles and more shallow storyline. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198032617314\/recommended\/3905450\/","votes_up":32},{"recommendationid":"234252513","appid":3905450,"accountid":1004963809,"playtime_at_review":90,"review_text":"So far its fun! You can easly play with friends because they don't need to buy the game too, they can join you FOR FREE using the FRIEND PASS, which was the Demo before.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198965229537\/recommended\/3905450\/","votes_up":15},{"recommendationid":"234259666","appid":3905450,"accountid":443891052,"playtime_at_review":129,"review_text":"Really fun and nostalgic splitscreen co-op. It reminds me of that car level in Toy Story 2 on PS1. Performance needs serious optimization though, I need to set graphics to low 1080p with max FSR to get a stable 60fps on my...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198404156780\/recommended\/3905450\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"234295736","appid":3905450,"accountid":160088066,"playtime_at_review":174,"review_text":"Gonna say that after taking our time on the first few levels, this is recommended. No complaints. Cute and fun 1990's Grounded \/ Honey I Shrunk the Kids vibes. It feels fairly polished. Graphics are really decent. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198120353794\/recommended\/3905450\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":2054970,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234281314","appid":2054970,"accountid":459864663,"playtime_at_review":2479,"review_text":"the performance is improved greatly now, it's actually insane everything maxed (except image quality and shadow) with Ray Tracing in 2K runs smoothly about 70-90fps and this also without DLSS\/Framegen bs the only issue i had...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198420130391\/recommended\/2054970\/","votes_up":11}]},{"appid":4317690,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"234257484","appid":4317690,"accountid":93036455,"playtime_at_review":60,"review_text":"Game feels great on controller. Definitely has a rhythm to it that took some getting use to, but it's a lot of fun. Can't wait to play with friends. Sucks it's getting review bombed day 1 cause \"can't rebind keys\".","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198053302183\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":169},{"recommendationid":"234259305","appid":4317690,"accountid":177370846,"playtime_at_review":128,"review_text":"Actually a really good game Honestly, Crimson Moon is a pretty good game. The only thing I keep seeing people complain about is not being able to set your own keybinds, and I really don't understand why that's enough to...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198137636574\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":15},{"recommendationid":"234263664","appid":4317690,"accountid":346074019,"playtime_at_review":171,"review_text":"game is fantastic, runs fairly well and is quite beautiful looking too. the negative reviews are blowing me away. You dont need an FOV slider in a souls game people who are complaining about that crack me up. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198306339747\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":15},{"recommendationid":"234261723","appid":4317690,"accountid":218283331,"playtime_at_review":234,"review_text":"SOLO REVIEW AFTER MORE THAN AN HOUR Extreme potential here, held back by some glaring issues. To preface, I played my first hour on controller. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198178549059\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":7},{"recommendationid":"234256745","appid":4317690,"accountid":872122440,"playtime_at_review":135,"review_text":"don't understand what everyone is so furiously upset about that they're voting this game negatively. i am having lots of fun playing it, and im excited to see what the devs continue to add down the line ^.^ there is minor...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198832388168\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":20},{"recommendationid":"234298652","appid":4317690,"accountid":177815123,"playtime_at_review":107,"review_text":"Darksiders-esque soulslike. Really fun with controller. Not really sure what the review bombs are about, but it's a great Soulslite.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198138080851\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"234256572","appid":4317690,"accountid":88843695,"playtime_at_review":76,"review_text":"Works fine on Linux with Proton-CachyOS (Latest) About the game: I liked it, but it needs some improvements to the controls, especially for a Souls-like game, like being able to modify the keybinds \u2014 it's much better on...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198049109423\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"234263646","appid":4317690,"accountid":363765432,"playtime_at_review":120,"review_text":"So far as a solo player I've enjoyed the game. I've seen what everyone else has written and I do agree that some of this stuff does need to fixed but so far the game IS PLAYABLE. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198324031160\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"234252218","appid":4317690,"accountid":153684549,"playtime_at_review":61,"review_text":"This game is exactly what I wanted. A dark soulsesque game. There are some flaws, but this is day one, I imagine they will patch the bugs out. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198113950277\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":10},{"recommendationid":"234259403","appid":4317690,"accountid":10356127,"playtime_at_review":155,"review_text":"Fun souls-quasi-rogue-like. Combat is fun and you get a lot of options as you play with weapons, armor, and trinkets. Seems to offer a good variety of builds and play styles which open up the more you play and unlock. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197970621855\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"234256667","appid":4317690,"accountid":52330523,"playtime_at_review":150,"review_text":"Having a blast with this so far. The pacing of combat and the loot mechanics make for some very addictive gameplay.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198012596251\/recommended\/4317690\/","votes_up":6}]}],
